§§ `For the owner who wants the fence: worked by hand, and equal to the baseline`

-- s 5: freehold (yes); a lease with 4 years left (no) or 5 (yes); a public reserve (no); a mere occupier (no).
#ASSERT `Am I an owner, wanting the fence` `as the owner wanting the fence` `I hold the freehold in possession` 0 FALSE EQUALS yes
#ASSERT `Am I an owner, wanting the fence` `as the owner wanting the fence` `I hold a lease` 4 FALSE EQUALS no
#ASSERT `Am I an owner, wanting the fence` `as the owner wanting the fence` `I hold a lease` 5 FALSE EQUALS yes
#ASSERT `Am I an owner, wanting the fence` `as the owner wanting the fence` `I hold the freehold in possession` 0 TRUE EQUALS no
#ASSERT `Am I an owner, wanting the fence` `as the owner wanting the fence` `I only occupy the land` 0 FALSE EQUALS no
#ASSERT `Am I an owner, wanting the fence` `as the owner wanting the fence` `I hold a lease` 5 FALSE EQUALS `yes if` (`Am I an owner under the Act` `I hold a lease` 5 FALSE)
-- s 5 "sufficient fence": the local-law kind (yes); no local law and no agreement, but substantial (yes); an agreed fence
-- that fails the local law, with a local law the fence does not meet (no).
#ASSERT `Is the fence sufficient, wanting the fence` `as the owner wanting the fence` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS yes
#ASSERT `Is the fence sufficient, wanting the fence` `as the owner wanting the fence` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS yes
#ASSERT `Is the fence sufficient, wanting the fence` `as the owner wanting the fence` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS no
#ASSERT `Is the fence sufficient, wanting the fence` `as the owner wanting the fence` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `yes if` (`Is the fence a sufficient fence` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT `What is my share of a new fence, wanting the fence` `as the owner wanting the fence` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `my share` `half: we join in or contribute in equal proportions (s 7)`
#ASSERT `What is my share of a new fence, wanting the fence` `as the owner wanting the fence` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `my share` `nothing under s 7: our lands are already divided by a sufficient fence`
#ASSERT `What is my share of a new fence, wanting the fence` `as the owner wanting the fence` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS `my share` `as our agreement says: the Act does not affect it (s 6(1))`
#ASSERT `What is my share of a new fence, wanting the fence` `as the owner wanting the fence` FALSE `an unasked fact` `an unasked fact` `an unasked fact` `an unasked fact` EQUALS `my share` `nothing under s 7: I am not an owner as the Act defines it`
#ASSERT `What is my share of a new fence, wanting the fence` `as the owner wanting the fence` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `my share` (`What share of a new dividing fence must I bear` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT `How much must I contribute, wanting the fence` `as the owner wanting the fence` 3000 TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS amount 1500
#ASSERT `How much must I contribute, wanting the fence` `as the owner wanting the fence` 3000 TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS amount 0
#ASSERT `How much must I contribute, wanting the fence` `as the owner wanting the fence` 3000 TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS amount (`How much must I contribute to the new fence` 3000 TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT `Is my notice to fence valid, wanting the fence` `as the owner wanting the fence` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS yes
#ASSERT `Is my notice to fence valid, wanting the fence` `as the owner wanting the fence` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS no
#ASSERT `Is my notice to fence valid, wanting the fence` `as the owner wanting the fence` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS `yes if` (`Is my notice to fence valid` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE)
-- s 9: "within 21 days after the giving of a notice": on day 22 without agreement (yes), day 21 (no), or agreed (no).
#ASSERT `May I apply to the court, wanting the fence` `as the owner wanting the fence` TRUE 22 FALSE EQUALS yes
#ASSERT `May I apply to the court, wanting the fence` `as the owner wanting the fence` TRUE 21 FALSE EQUALS no
#ASSERT `May I apply to the court, wanting the fence` `as the owner wanting the fence` TRUE 30 TRUE EQUALS no
