#ASSERT `What can my neighbour recover from me for a repair` `as the owner asked to pay` `wear, age or ordinary deterioration` FALSE TRUE 5 `I disputed the need or objected to the repairs, in writing` FALSE EQUALS `my neighbour can recover` `the Magistrates Court decides, if my neighbour applies under s 15(4)`
#ASSERT `What can my neighbour recover from me for a repair` `as the owner asked to pay` `wear, age or ordinary deterioration` FALSE FALSE 0 `I have not replied in writing` FALSE EQUALS `my neighbour can recover` `nothing yet: my neighbour must give me a repair notice and wait 14 days for my written reply (s 15(1), (3))`
#ASSERT `What can my neighbour recover from me for a repair` `as the owner asked to pay` `wear, age or ordinary deterioration` TRUE TRUE 20 `I have not replied in writing` FALSE EQUALS `my neighbour can recover` `each of us bears the cost of repairing the part we built (s 15(7)(a))`
